      "mutation_intent": "Create a variant where multiple nearby actors are present on both sides of the ego’s nominal lane, still triggering perception/prediction and leaving planning waypoints unblocked, while maintaining the condition that high-level vehicle_cmd remains near zero despite a collision, preserving the ambiguous controller responsibility.",
